### 2. CREATE TEST ROOM
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/Rooms/AddOrUpdate
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": "",
  "naam": "Test Zaal",
  "rijen": 10,
  "stoelenPerRij": 15
}

###

### 3. CREATE TEST FILM
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/Films/AddOrUpdate
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": "",
  "name": "Test Movie",
  "rating": "PG-13",
  "genre": "Action",
  "duration": 120,
  "description": "Test film for reservations"
}

###

### 4. CREATE TEST SHOW (uses FilmId + RoomId from above)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/Shows/AddOrUpdate
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": "",
  "startDate": "2025-12-10T14:00:00Z",
  "endDate": "2025-12-10T16:00:00Z",
  "filmId": "d72eb037-27e8-425a-9e2f-3012c7e70dac",
  "roomId": "aec916f3-c29a-4fcb-829b-5eea3076bf9b"
}

###

### 5. CREATE RESERVATION (your CRUD!)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/Reservation
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": "19C36789-BA39-4DAA-8CF9-C1BC77765C4D",
  "showId": "a70c74e4-bc00-4986-be23-b3475c987ca2",
  "seatNumbers": [30, 31, 32]
}

###

### 6. GET RESERVED SEATS
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/Reservation/show/A70C74E4-BC00-4986-BE23-B3475C987CA2/seats

###

### 7. UPDATE RESERVATION
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/Reservation/0aabd017-d6b3-4e12-801a-499e4784a506
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": "19C36789-BA39-4DAA-8CF9-C1BC77765C4D",
  "seatNumbers": [5, 6, 7]
}

###

POST http://localhost:5275/api/Reservation/test


###

### 8. DELETE RESERVATION
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/Reservation/0aabd017-d6b3-4e12-801a-499e4784a506?userId=19C36789-BA39-4DAA-8CF9-C1BC77765C4D

###

### 9. VERIFY DELETE (should be empty)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/Reservation/show/0aabd017-d6b3-4e12-801a-499e4784a506/seats



### Verify USER exists
GET http://localhost:5275/api/Users/GetById?id=19C36789-BA39-4DAA-8CF9-C1BC77765C4D

### Verify ROOM exists  
GET http://localhost:5275/api/Rooms/GetById?id=aec916f3-c29a-4fcb-829b-5eea3076bf9b

